<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.pool.commits ~ commit ~ only what the house agrees with, under a lar: subject

`lares surface commit` stages only the changed paths the house already agrees with (each read against its synced base), commits them under a `lar:` subject naming no face, and never pushes; a path apart names why. `-m <seam>` or `--message <seam>` names the seam slug, else the hand's. `--realm <realm pet name>` commits each standing tree of the realm, one commit per tree.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ face · realm

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`face` params=`message/sitting-close ~ commit the worn face's pool`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`realm` params=`realm/notes ~ one commit per realm tree`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · message · realm

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`message` params=`takes/seam ~ the seam, one slug (a-z, 0-9, -); also spelled -m`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`realm` params=`takes/pet-name ~ the realm whose trees commit; never beside face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ commits git trees on this host; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · surface-no-pool · surface-seam-malformed · surface-git-status-failed · surface-git-add-failed · surface-commit-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.pool.commits message/sitting-close]] ~ a stray word, a malformed seam or realm`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-no-pool` params=`cure/[[face.pool.lays]] ~ no pool stands at the root`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-seam-malformed` params=`~ the seam reads as no slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-git-status-failed` params=`~ git status failed in the pool`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-git-add-failed` params=`~ git add failed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-commit-refused` params=`~ git refused the commit`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

